Nope, there's no pickpocketing in vanilla Nethack, at least not in
your natural form. Probably the best way to get a stolen AoLS back is
to tame the nymph (scroll of taming or magic harp), and she'll drop
it.  You can also polymorph into a monster with a steal attack --
nymph or foocubus -- and smack her to steal it back.  Being in one of
these forms will also prevent nymphs from stealing from you.


